Third-party material in this repository

- Nordic Semiconductor nRF5 SDK 17.1.0: bootloader/main.c, bootloader/config/sdk_config.h,
  bootloader/armgcc/*, bootloader/nrf_crypto_allocator.h, app/config/sdk_config.h and the
  linker scripts are derived from SDK examples and remain under the Nordic 5-Clause License
  (see the headers in those files). The SDK itself and the SoftDevice are not included; they
  are downloaded from Nordic (see README).
- Game-controller protocol (app/src/game.c) follows the reverse engineering published by
  TrikiEmu (https://github.com/Maku-hub/TrikiEmu, MIT) and TrikiVR
  (https://github.com/CreoleVR/TrikiVR, MIT).
- The configuration service is protocol-compatible with Everytag
  (https://github.com/vasimv/Everytag).
- docs/pinout.jpg is photos/TIKIpinout.jpg from zabka-triki-hardware by Dawid Piwowarski
  (https://github.com/Piwencjusz/zabka-triki-hardware), resized. That repository has no
  license file; the photo is used with attribution and will be removed on the author's request.
